Time caveat for Corollary L1 at its own threshold p = kappa^E (E r + 2), kappa=2, J=3, r=40:
  p = 36096, |Good| >= p/(2k^E) = 141.0, |Bad| <= Er/2 = 140.0, |Good|-|Bad| >= 1.0: rejection sampling needs up to p/(|Good|-|Bad|) = 36096 expected trials per level (Theorem A: <= 2 kappa^E = 256)
  at Theorem A's own p = 2 E r kappa^E = 71680: |Good|-|Bad| >= 140.0, trials <= 512.0 = 4 kappa^E
